{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0294_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0294_1000_p", "source_sha256": "a1f4a2614ff6b0e912f33e1e00275760c9718d2afeab23d338b7f8b8d6a045a2", "ja": "（今日は一日中、水着での撮影だ。なかなか\nハードだけど、百合子は頑張ってくれている！）", "zh": "（今天一整天都要穿着泳装拍摄。虽然相当辛苦，但百合子一直在努力！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0294_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0294_1001_p", "source_sha256": "6bd5a7e785a86d14af00091713a16c5163d8b4f37bd1d41fa07643c3d470ce1c", "ja": "百合子、お疲れ様。\n大丈夫か？　結構続いちゃってるけど。", "zh": "百合子，辛苦了。\n还撑得住吗？已经持续挺久了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0294_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0294_1002_026yur", "source_sha256": "5faca50f33acdcccce5decb47363fd08d8dda6e6bfa04b4ef2a45fbe9955e8fc", "ja": "うう、{$P$}さん……。\n私、そろそろ限界かも……？", "zh": "呜呜，{$P$}先生……我可能快到极限了……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0294_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0294_1003_026yur", "source_sha256": "c31654e68a801658eb75d19f239ac16f74a5aa670306b5175b78439dcad40a9b", "ja": "ウォータースポーツって、そこまで慣れてませんし。\n障害物レースがすっごくハードで……。", "zh": "我对水上运动还没那么熟悉。\n障碍赛实在太艰难了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0294_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0294_1004_026yur", "source_sha256": "5d36c15d27685e97fbfd09f0ab2e8bd528c4557b89547ec166aaa245ba3f095c", "ja": "で、でも……以前の私だったら、倒れていると\n思うんです！　ちょっとは体力、ついてきたのかな？", "zh": "可、可是……换作以前的我，应该早就倒下了！看来我的体力也稍微有所提升了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0294_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0294_1005_p", "source_sha256": "a40c1fb4a1182beadd62f625aa0fbb4a54360321f669849c31313c85db85ff6d", "ja": "うん、毎日のレッスンの成果かもしれない。\nどうだろう？　最後の撮影も、いけそうか？", "zh": "嗯，说不定是每天练习的成果呢。\n怎么样？最后的拍摄也能坚持下来吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0294_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0294_1006_026yur", "source_sha256": "8e06e2252f6cd79c783dd962a422923ef0f5e823eda81d690ebc223a861302da", "ja": "最後の撮影……？　そ、そうでした……！\n確か、波打ち際ではしゃぐ撮影ですよね？", "zh": "最后的拍摄……？那、那对哦……！\n好像是在海浪边嬉戏的拍摄对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0294_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0294_1007_026yur", "source_sha256": "2890a7f0eae4cf780dded0dc79a60639af05297fb8bbc63ce83de5c792138a2d", "ja": "だ、大丈夫かな……頑張りたい気持ちは\nすっごくあるんですけど、ちょっと不安かも……。", "zh": "不、不知道能不能顺利……我真的非常想努力，可还是有点不安……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0294_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0294_1008_p", "source_sha256": "ce681124251168a0b6dd04ea8f93348e5ea111d6fd93546305b490306538d413", "ja": "だよな……うん。やっぱり一度休憩を入れようか？", "zh": "对啊……嗯，还是先休息一下吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0294_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0294_1009_026yur", "source_sha256": "85c3ef4599c08b6e7deec7c6cd12ee75c6cb24b68224d0119346d53d4ca756b1", "ja": "でも、時間押しちゃってるんですよね？\nスタッフさんをお待たせするの、悪いですよね……。", "zh": "不过，已经耽误时间了吧？\n让工作人员一直等着，也不太好……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0294_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0294_1010_026yur", "source_sha256": "0a5baaec7059ffc9bf84579d4f745d13c7fc7410c28edd9989ae1040139a0456", "ja": "うう……とは言っても、私にはもう、\nパラソルの下で読書をするくらいの体力しか……。", "zh": "呜呜……话虽如此，我已经只剩下在遮阳伞下看书的体力了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0294_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0294_1011_026yur", "source_sha256": "e1a9c0097e30a6363f84901be5a4643f1f3e84bd3480dbd41ddc43fa10592e2f", "ja": "はっ！　こうなったら水の精霊に頼んで\n回復を？　いやでも、他属性の精霊とは親和性が……。", "zh": "啊！既然这样，就拜托水之精灵帮忙恢复体力？不对，可我和其他属性的精灵相性……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0294_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0294_1012_p", "source_sha256": "30d9384daf3f52b6278f4364ead28575d982bf35bd74fbb7e03898864313003a", "ja": "待て百合子、現実逃避する必要はないぞ！\n疲れているなら、そういうコンセプトにしたらいい。", "zh": "等等百合子，没必要逃避现实！\n既然累了，那就做成这种概念好了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0294_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0294_1013_026yur", "source_sha256": "edfea0452ebf3f5d3698ea494530c10fdaa811a9a46859b2fe0448a823904c78", "ja": "えっ、それってつまり……疲れた私でも撮れるような、\nだらけた感じってことですか！？", "zh": "诶，也就是说……是那种连疲惫的我也能拍出来的慵懒感觉吗！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0294_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0294_1014_p", "source_sha256": "a3b61315b10147a506b06b6b15586e7e8a468caea2edd26a1282bf47cc0ec9bc", "ja": "いやそんな身も蓋もない……。\nムード重視と言ってもらいたいな。", "zh": "不，别说得这么直白嘛……\n我更希望你能说是重视气氛呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0294_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0294_1015_p", "source_sha256": "358c1e4e1000c669ce3c2b6e054173c2956781751a62f7abdc9764cd49ac27c6", "ja": "日も暮れてきて、ロケーションもバッチリだし。\n百合子なら、どんなシチュエーションが思いつく？", "zh": "天也快黑了，场景也正合适。要是百合子的话，你能想到什么样的情境？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0294_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0294_1016_026yur", "source_sha256": "30e3b2e0f3b374a785da283ca60128310eccd0fdc5c0de93a6f5e7adeffa1972", "ja": "うーん、そうですね……夕暮れの海……。\n友達以上、恋人未満の、ふたり……。", "zh": "嗯——这个嘛……黄昏的大海……  \n关系超过朋友、却还不是恋人的两个人……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0294_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0294_1017_026yur", "source_sha256": "7fecfd5db7e4f3214747cff41cf5f56958b23f9ede55c5fe638ea53fad26cc00", "ja": "はしゃいでしまって、遊び疲れてしまったふたりは、\n波打ち際に寝そべって……とか！", "zh": "玩得太尽兴、累得筋疲力尽的两个人，躺在海浪拍打的岸边……之类的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0294_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0294_1018_p", "source_sha256": "80b45048d2b27b741a61eb2bac0404ece091aabb96ee244f57646830d90bff3b", "ja": "なるほど。いつもより少し大人びた百合子の姿に、\n相手も意識してしまう……うん、いいじゃないか！", "zh": "原来如此。面对比平时稍显成熟的百合子，对方也不由得在意起来……嗯，这不是挺好的吗！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0294_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0294_1019_026yur", "source_sha256": "d404cb0af8943d03abbe1f407321b284a041f68fb58c7115f2518289c58f0530", "ja": "友達のはずが、急接近的な……！\nそれって反則級の、王道攻略ルートですよねっ！", "zh": "明明应该是朋友，却突然拉近距离……！\n这可是犯规级别的王道攻略路线吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0294_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0294_1020_p", "source_sha256": "93e34a0322a1fa71e6fe339514dd14050c7b76e8f5102481ca75ff33a423edfe", "ja": "反則なのに王道とは……いや。\nまあとにかく、そういう設定でいけそうか？", "zh": "明明是犯规却又是王道路……算了。总之，设定成那样应该没问题吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0294_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0294_1021_026yur", "source_sha256": "85005c8600ad5072cc51b35a20d250420de1f949a530059358712fd6dc8703d8", "ja": "はい、それなら激しい動きもないですし、\n今の私でも大丈夫だと思います！　すぅー……はぁー。", "zh": "是的，那样的话也没有激烈的动作，\n现在的我应该也没问题！　吸——……呼——。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0294_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0294_1022_026yur", "source_sha256": "af5adae4c5f58a8dee24c15e4bdeafffda4d516ec5730c92d02d75f9feb8b0aa", "ja": "よしっ！　残された体力を総動員して……。\n精一杯、やってみますね！　なんだかノッてきました♪", "zh": "好！我要调动剩下的全部体力……\n竭尽全力试一试！总觉得来劲了♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0294_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0294_1023_p", "source_sha256": "9d094a87144365725920a34fadb7672273d3fda1362951ed9c6f8f1f113cc565", "ja": "（その後、スタッフの了解も得られて、恋人風の\n最高の一枚が撮れた！　よく頑張ったな、百合子！）", "zh": "（之后，在得到工作人员同意后，拍出了恋人般的最佳照片！干得漂亮，百合子！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
